  user_input {
    user_response: "ini untuk create visit :\n\nDesign the **SalesFlow Pro Schedule Visit web page**.\n\nHeader:\n\nBreadcrumb:\nVisits / Schedule Visit\n\nTitle:\n\"Schedule Customer Visit\"\n\nUse a two-column desktop form.\n\nLeft column:\n\nVisit Information\n\nCustomer\nVisit Date\nVisit Time\nLocation\nVisit Purpose\n\nRight column:\n\nOwnership\n\nPIC\nAdditional Participants\nNotes\n\nPIC selector must be a searchable dropdown.\n\nEach user result displays:\n\nAvatar\nName\nRole\nActive Tasks\nOverdue Tasks\nWorkload\n\nExample:\n\nAhmad\nSales Representative\n\n8 active tasks\n2 overdue\nMedium workload\n\nBelow the form create a visit summary card.\n\nSummary:\n\nCustomer\nDate\nTime\nLocation\nPIC\n\nActions:\n\nCancel\nSave Draft\nSchedule Visit"
    items {
      text: "ini untuk create visit :\n\nDesign the **SalesFlow Pro Schedule Visit web page**.\n\nHeader:\n\nBreadcrumb:\nVisits / Schedule Visit\n\nTitle:\n\"Schedule Customer Visit\"\n\nUse a two-column desktop form.\n\nLeft column:\n\nVisit Information\n\nCustomer\nVisit Date\nVisit Time\nLocation\nVisit Purpose\n\nRight column:\n\nOwnership\n\nPIC\nAdditional Participants\nNotes\n\nPIC selector must be a searchable dropdown.\n\nEach user result displays:\n\nAvatar\nName\nRole\nActive Tasks\nOverdue Tasks\nWorkload\n\nExample:\n\nAhmad\nSales Representative\n\n8 active tasks\n2 overdue\nMedium workload\n\nBelow the form create a visit summary card.\n\nSummary:\n\nCustomer\nDate\nTime\nLocation\nPIC\n\nActions:\n\nCancel\nSave Draft\nSchedule Visit"
    }
  }
}
