ning Card Behavior**\n\nI\'m now changing the calendar view cards to use the navigation logic I implemented for the list view\'s date cell and view icons. Specifically, I\'m replacing the `onClick` event handler, which called `setViewingVisit(v)`, with a `navigate(`/visits/${v.id}`)`, to align the behavior. I am also replacing the div with a clickable button. I\'ve ensured to use `e.stopPropagation()` to handle event bubbling correctly.\n\n\n"
