    response: "I have updated the application to enforce role-based access control for the **Team Tasks** page.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Protected Routing**: I enhanced the `<ProtectedRoute>` component in the main application logic (`App.tsx`) to support checking against a list of specific allowed roles.\n- **Route Guard**: The `/team-tasks` route is now strictly protected. If a standard Sales Representative attempts to access the URL directly, they will be instantly redirected to their main dashboard. It is now only accessible to `SUPERVISOR`, `SALES_MANAGER`, `TENANT_ADMIN`, and `SUPER_ADMIN` roles.\n- **Dynamic Navigation (Sidebar)**: I updated the sidebar navigation menu to dynamically evaluate the logged-in user\'s role. The \"Team Tasks\" menu item will now remain completely hidden for standard sales representatives, keeping their workspace uncluttered."
