  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully updated the sidebar to group all task-related pages under a collapsible \"Tasks\" menu section.\n\nHere is a summary of the changes:\n- **Collapsible Menu Design**: I replaced the old single \"Tasks\" link with a parent menu and an expandable list of child menus.\n- **Hierarchy Implementation**: \n  - Added **My Tasks** for all users.\n  - Moved **Team Tasks** into this new sub-menu. In accordance with role permissions, this menu item remains visible strictly for supervisors and managers.\n  - Added **Task Board** as an additional option beneath it, providing room for board view expansions.\n- **Route Active States**: Updated the sidebar so that when a user is on any child task page, the main \"Tasks\" parent link stays actively highlighted, helping preserve navigation context."
