      text: "Design the **SalesFlow Pro Task Board** as a desktop Kanban interface.\n\nHeader:\n\n\"Task Board\"\n\nFilters:\n\nCustomer\nPIC\nPriority\nDue Date\n\nKanban columns:\n\nTODO\nIN PROGRESS\nREVIEW\nCOMPLETED\n\nEach column displays:\n\nColumn title\nTask count\n\nTask card:\n\nFollow up quotation\n\nPT Maju Jaya\n\n[Avatar] Ahmad\n\nPriority:\nHigh\n\nDue:\n12 Aug 2026\n\nRelated:\nVisit \342\200\224 Product Presentation\n\nCards must support drag and drop.\n\nWhen a task moves to another status, record the change in Activity History.\n\nProvide \"+ Add Task\" action in each column.\n\nUse wide desktop layout with horizontally scrollable columns."
