  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Followups Page**\n\nI\'m starting a complete overhaul of `FollowupsPage`, since the existing version doesn\'t fit the current needs. I\'m focusing on the layout and primary action buttons right now, with a header of \"Follow-ups\" and a \"+ Create Follow-up\" button.\n\n\n**Defining Follow-up Structure**\n\nI\'ve outlined the core structure for the follow-up page. Quick filters will include \"All\", \"Due Today\", \"Upcoming\", \"Completed\", and \"Overdue\" tabs. A filter toolbar will allow search, customer, PIC, status, and date range options. Data will be displayed in a table with columns for customer, action, related items, PIC, due date, status, and actions. Status badges will visually indicate the state, and each row will have action buttons for viewing, editing, completing, or reassigning. I plan to use `DataService.getFollowUps()` for data, and `getCustomers()`/`getUsers()` for filter options. I\'m starting on the filtering logic now.\n\n\n"
