    response: "I have successfully designed and built the **SalesFlow Pro Opportunity List** view as requested. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **View Switcher**: Added a clean toggle control in the header section, allowing you to seamlessly switch between the visual Kanban Pipeline and the structured List view.\n- **Advanced Filtering & Actions**: Implemented a comprehensive toolbar for the List view with a Search input and Dropdown filters (Stage, Customer, PIC, Expected Close), paired with visual controls for Exporting, Sorting, and Column Visibility.\n- **Detailed Data Table**: Constructed a highly scannable table layout merging related metrics cleanly into structured columns (Opportunity & Customer, Value & Probability, Stage, PIC, Expected Close). \n- **Prominent Financials**: Emphasized the Opportunity Value column with bold typography and a distinct emerald green color to ensure primary financial metrics stand out.\n- **Bulk Selection & Pagination**: Added functional checkbox selection (which reveals a contextual bulk action strip for updating or reassigning deals) and full pagination controls at the bottom of the table.\n\nYou can view the new design by navigating to the **Opportunities** section and toggling the view mode in the header!"
