  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the `Encountered two children with the same key` error!\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe issue was occurring when dragging and dropping an opportunity in the Pipeline view. Updating an opportunity was calling `addActivity` twice within the exact same millisecond\342\200\224once automatically by the data service logging the stage change, and once manually by the UI component logging the specifics. Because the local `addActivity` method generated IDs strictly using `ACT-${Date.now()}`, both objects were being created with the exact same ID, causing React\'s `.map()` to throw the duplicate key warning.\n\n**Fix Applied:**\nI updated `src/services/dataService.ts` to append a randomized alphanumeric suffix to the activity ID generator (`ACT-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 5)}`). This ensures perfectly unique component keys even when multiple writes happen simultaneously.\n\nThe application is fully built and running perfectly! Let me know what you would like to work on next."
    modified_response: "I have resolved the `Encountered two children with the same key` error!\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe issue was occurring when dragging and dropping an opportunity in the Pipeline view. Updating an opportunity was calling `addActivity` twice within the exact same millisecond\342\200\224once automatically by the data service logging the stage change, and once manually by the UI component logging the specifics. Because the local `addActivity` method generated IDs strictly using `ACT-${Date.now()}`, both objects were being created with the exact same ID, causing React\'s `.map()` to throw the duplicate key warning.\n\n**Fix Applied:**\nI updated `src/services/dataService.ts` to append a randomized alphanumeric suffix to the activity ID generator (`ACT-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 5)}`). This ensures perfectly unique component keys even when multiple writes happen simultaneously.\n\nThe application is fully built and running perfectly! Let me know what you would like to work on next."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
