  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully designed and built the **SalesFlow Pro Create Opportunity** page.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Clean Two-Column Layout**: Created a highly organized layout prioritizing clarity. The left column captures core **Opportunity Information** (Name, Customer, Value, Dates, Stage, Probability), while the right column handles **Ownership** (PIC assignment and detailed notes).\n- **Custom PIC Selector Component**: Implemented a rich dropdown component for assigning the Person in Charge (PIC). It features inline search, avatars, and visualizes real-time workload metrics (Active Tasks, Open Opps, and a \"High Workload\" warning indicator) to help users balance team distribution.\n- **Smart Form Logic**: \n  - Probability ranges auto-adjust securely based on the selected Stage (Prospect = 10%, Qualification = 25%, Proposal = 50%, Negotiation = 75%, Won = 100%).\n  - Built-in currency formatting instantly updates for the \"Estimated Value\" field.\n- **Contextual Actions**: Added \"Cancel\", \"Save Draft\", and \"Create Opportunity\" buttons to the top header for quick form operations.\n- **Navigation Wiring**: Hooked up the \"New Opportunity\" button on the main Opportunities dashboard to route smoothly to this new dedicated view.\n\nYou can check it out by clicking the **New Opportunity** button on the Opportunities page! Let me know what feature you would like to build next."
    modified_response: "I have successfully designed and built the **SalesFlow Pro Create Opportunity** page.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Clean Two-Column Layout**: Created a highly organized layout prioritizing clarity. The left column captures core **Opportunity Information** (Name, Customer, Value, Dates, Stage, Probability), while the right column handles **Ownership** (PIC assignment and detailed notes).\n- **Custom PIC Selector Component**: Implemented a rich dropdown component for assigning the Person in Charge (PIC). It features inline search, avatars, and visualizes real-time workload metrics (Active Tasks, Open Opps, and a \"High Workload\" warning indicator) to help users balance team distribution.\n- **Smart Form Logic**: \n  - Probability ranges auto-adjust securely based on the selected Stage (Prospect = 10%, Qualification = 25%, Proposal = 50%, Negotiation = 75%, Won = 100%).\n  - Built-in currency formatting instantly updates for the \"Estimated Value\" field.\n- **Contextual Actions**: Added \"Cancel\", \"Save Draft\", and \"Create Opportunity\" buttons to the top header for quick form operations.\n- **Navigation Wiring**: Hooked up the \"New Opportunity\" button on the main Opportunities dashboard to route smoothly to this new dedicated view.\n\nYou can check it out by clicking the **New Opportunity** button on the Opportunities page! Let me know what feature you would like to build next."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
