  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the **Customer Report** for SalesFlow Pro.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Header & Action Bar**: Implemented a clean header with \"Print\" and \"Export\" action buttons using standard icon integrations. \n- **Filter Navigation**: Built a responsive, horizontal grid for segmenting the report by Date Range, Customer Status, Customer Type, and PIC (Employee).\n- **Core KPIs**: Designed six high-contrast metric cards across the top (Total, New, Active, Prospects, Won, and Inactive Customers). Each incorporates subtle color coding, appropriate icons, and bold typography.\n- **Visual Analytics**: \n  - **Customers by Status**: A donut chart showcasing portfolio health (Active, Prospect, Inactive). \n  - **Customers by PIC**: A horizontal bar chart identifying portfolio sizes by employee.\n  - **New Customers Trend**: An area chart displaying historical acquisition velocity over the months.\n  - **Customer Activity**: A stacked bar chart visualizing weekly engagement across visits, tasks, and follow-ups.\n- **Detailed Directory**: Added a comprehensive data table with a search input. The table displays Customer profiles, Status tags (with distinct color backgrounds), PIC, metrics for Visits/Tasks/Follow-ups/Opportunities, and Last Activity dates.\n\nYou can view the new dashboard by navigating to the \"Customer Report\" link added to the left sidebar menu. Please let me know what you would like to tackle next!"
