  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the **User Profile** page for SalesFlow Pro.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Profile Layout**: Utilized a clean, two-column desktop layout that presents personal identity on the left and administrative details on the right.\n- **Identity Card**: Built a prominent profile card displaying the user\'s avatar, role, department, and contact information with quick action \"Edit\" buttons.\n- **Performance Statistics**: Integrated a 2x2 grid of key metric cards (Active Tasks, Visits This Month, Open Opportunities, and Sales Value) directly below the identity section for quick performance visibility.\n- **Data Sections**: \n  - **Personal Information**: Structured a grid showing First Name, Last Name, Email, Phone, Location, and Timezone.\n  - **Account Security**: Added a streamlined panel to track password freshness and trigger a \"Change Password\" action.\n  - **Activity History**: Implemented a vertical timeline detailing recent actions (completed visits, updated stages, system logins) with color-coded iconography.\n- **Navigation Integration**: Updated the top navigation bar\'s profile dropdown to seamlessly route the user to this new `/profile` page.\n\nYou can view the profile page by clicking on the avatar icon in the top right corner and selecting **Profile**!"
    modified_response: "I have completed the **User Profile** page for SalesFlow Pro.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Profile Layout**: Utilized a clean, two-column desktop layout that presents personal identity on the left and administrative details on the right.\n- **Identity Card**: Built a prominent profile card displaying the user\'s avatar, role, department, and contact information with quick action \"Edit\" buttons.\n- **Performance Statistics**: Integrated a 2x2 grid of key metric cards (Active Tasks, Visits This Month, Open Opportunities, and Sales Value) directly below the identity section for quick performance visibility.\n- **Data Sections**: \n  - **Personal Information**: Structured a grid showing First Name, Last Name, Email, Phone, Location, and Timezone.\n  - **Account Security**: Added a streamlined panel to track password freshness and trigger a \"Change Password\" action.\n  - **Activity History**: Implemented a vertical timeline detailing recent actions (completed visits, updated stages, system logins) with color-coded iconography.\n- **Navigation Integration**: Updated the top navigation bar\'s profile dropdown to seamlessly route the user to this new `/profile` page.\n\nYou can view the profile page by clicking on the avatar icon in the top right corner and selecting **Profile**!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
