    response: "I have built the **Notification Settings** page for SalesFlow Pro.\n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Clean Structure**: Implemented a responsive layout that organizes preferences into distinct categorical cards: Tasks, Visits, Follow-ups, Opportunities, and PIC (Employee reassignments).\n- **Interactive Toggles**: Built a custom, animated toggle component that cleanly transitions between on and off states without relying on default browser checkboxes.\n- **Granular Controls**: Detailed every requested setting with clear titles and explanatory descriptions (e.g., distinguishing between \"Task Assigned\", \"Task Due Soon\", and \"Task Overdue\").\n- **State Management**: Linked the UI to a localized state object that supports resetting back to defaults or staging changes for save.\n- **Navigation Menu**: Added a direct link to the new Notification Settings page inside the User Profile dropdown menu in the top right corner.\n\nYou can view the new settings page immediately by clicking on your avatar icon in the top right and selecting \"Notification Settings\". Let me know if there are any tweaks or additional features you\'d like to implement!"
