ed references to \'follow-up\' updates and activities. Next, I am working on removing the modal JSX.\n\n\n**Deleting Modal JSX**\n\nI\'m presently removing the follow-up modal\'s JSX structure. I\'m taking out the entire div block that handles its rendering and functionality within the component. This removal is the final step in completely eliminating the follow-up feature from the UI.\n\n\n**Erasing Input Fields**\n\nI\'m currently removing the input fields within the deleted follow-up modal\'s JSX, specifically the title, type, and scheduled date fields. I\'m focusing on the component\'s structure to ensure the removal is clean and that these elements are no longer present.\n\n\n**Eliminating Input Elements**\n\nI\'m removing the remaining input elements from the follow-up modal, including the notes field and its associated state updates. The last of the `textarea` elements and associated `onChange` handlers are being addressed to finalize this comprehensive clean-up.\n\n\n\n"
