sing on rendering the list of comments themselves. I\'m iterating through the comment data, creating the individual comment entries. Each entry will include the user\'s initial in a circular avatar, their name, the timestamp, and the comment text, formatted for readability, and accounting for cases with no comments. I\'ve added a divider if there are comments to separate them.\n\n\n"
